Package: hflsnap
Type: Package
Title: Household Finance Lab Empirical Snapshot Template
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Joseph Nathan", "Cohen", email = "jncohen@qc.cuny.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Ships the fonts, LaTeX template, citation style, and starter
    R Markdown file used to produce Household Finance Lab (HFL) Empirical
    Snapshots. hfl_use() copies these support files into a new project
    folder; render_snapshot() knits the one-page PDF and its WordPress
    companion HTML. This package supplies files and a thin rendering
    wrapper only -- it does not define a custom rmarkdown output format,
    so snapshot.Rmd files remain plain rmarkdown::pdf_document documents
    that any collaborator can knit without the package installed, as
    long as the copied support files stay in the project folder.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
Imports:
    rmarkdown,
    tools
Suggests:
    tinytex
